# Next Supabase Serverless

- Prefer Next.js Server Actions for database mutations.
- Use API routes for webhooks, cron handlers, and external callbacks.
- Enforce Supabase RLS policies on all relevant tables.
- For Vercel cron endpoints, validate `CRON_SECRET` from header or query.
- Keep Vercel compatibility; avoid server-dependent heavy runtime patterns.
